From 5a24c1145eceedd27223375360924d45c93d7f35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:22:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Flash Next DFlash2: automatic draft width

Each round verifies only as many drafts as the selector's confidence says pay off:
the extent maximizes expected kept tokens per column of round cost. One-row verify
forwards run on per-width CUDA graphs and record a prefix of the GDN replay window.
NINFER_FLASH_DFLASH2_AUTO=<round cost in columns> turns it on (0 = fixed width),
NINFER_FLASH_DFLASH2_AUTO_POWER sharpens the confidence (2 is calibrated on the Spark).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
